1
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:06,900
It worked! The Getter Rays are flowing!

2
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,050
Yes! That's it!

3
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:18,700
Keep going! Keep going just like that!

4
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:25,800
What?!

5
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:28,650
What's wrong?

6
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:31,150
Doctor! This is...!

7
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:34,300
Were there too many Getter Rays?

8
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:38,800
You mean... it shorted out?

9
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:42,950
To circulate this many Getter Rays through its
body,

10
00:00:42,950 --> 00:00:46,050
we must study every detail more closely...

11
00:00:48,050 --> 00:00:49,550
Shut off the Getter Rays!

12
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:52,050
Wait! I want to find the cause!

13
00:00:52,050 --> 00:00:54,350
Reduce the energy output to one third!

14
00:00:54,350 --> 00:00:56,400
Check every affected section!

15
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:57,150
Yes, sir!

16
00:00:58,650 --> 00:01:01,900
Father, you should get some rest...

17
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:08,800
The stars are beautiful.

18
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:12,750
It was a night like this when I discovered Getter
Rays.

19
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:15,600
Truly the discovery of the century.

20
00:01:16,100 --> 00:01:19,000
Just a tiny amount yields tremendous energy.

21
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,950
A miraculous light...

22
00:01:20,950 --> 00:01:23,250
The discovery of Getter Rays

23
00:01:23,250 --> 00:01:26,300
opened up endless possibilities for our research.

24
00:01:26,650 --> 00:01:29,200
But Father, even if it's for space exploration,

25
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:32,900
aren't you rushing the Getter Project?

26
00:01:34,900 --> 00:01:40,950
Dad, shouldn't we have taken more time with this
experiment, too?

27
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,900
We must hurry...

28
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:02,600
Someone get Dr. Saotome!

29
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:04,500
What's happened?

30
00:02:04,750 --> 00:02:07,300
The Getter Ray circuits are opening one by one!

31
00:02:07,300 --> 00:02:08,500
Impossible!

32
00:02:09,950 --> 00:02:12,200
Could the Getter Rays themselves be...?

33
00:02:12,900 --> 00:02:13,900
Doctor!
